<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8"/>
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0"/>
<title>AI Find Games – Privacy Policy</title>
<style>
:root{
  --bg:#0f1115;
  --card:#1a1d24;
  --card2:#20242d;
  --text:#e6e6e6;
  --muted:#b0b3c0;
  --radius:16px;
  --line:rgba(255,255,255,0.06);
  --accent1:#00cc66;
  --accent2:#00ff88;
}
body{
  margin:0;
  padding:24px;
  background:var(--bg);
  color:var(--text);
  font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,"Segoe UI",Roboto,Arial,sans-serif;
  line-height:1.6;
}
.container{
  max-width:820px;
  margin:0 auto;
}
h1{
  font-size:2rem;
  margin-bottom:8px;
}
h2{
  font-size:1.2rem;
  margin-top:32px;
  margin-bottom:8px;
  color:var(--text);
}
.subtitle{
  color:var(--muted);
  margin-bottom:28px;
}
.card{
  background:var(--card);
  border-radius:var(--radius);
  border:1px solid var(--line);
  box-shadow:0 6px 18px rgba(0,0,0,0.25);
  overflow:hidden;
  position:relative;
  padding:24px 24px 24px 28px;
  margin-bottom:14px;
}
.card::before{
  content:"";
  position:absolute;
  left:0;
  top:0;
  height:100%;
  width:3px;
  background:linear-gradient(180deg,var(--accent1),var(--accent2));
}
p{
  color:var(--muted);
  margin:0 0 12px;
}
p:last-child{
  margin-bottom:0;
}
strong{
  color:var(--text);
}
ul{
  padding-left:18px;
  color:var(--muted);
}
li{
  margin-bottom:8px;
}
a{
  color:var(--accent2);
}
.updated{
  font-size:13px;
  color:var(--muted);
  margin-bottom:32px;
}
@media(max-width:600px){
  body{padding:18px;}
  h1{font-size:1.7rem;}
}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="container">

  <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
  <p class="subtitle">AI Find Games — LM Tech Studio</p>
  <p class="updated">Last updated: May 2026</p>

  <div class="card">
    <h2>1. Introduction</h2>
    <p>LM Tech Studio ("we", "our", "us") operates the AI Find Games mobile application ("the App"). This Privacy Policy explains what data we collect, how we use it, and your rights regarding your personal information.</p>
    <p>By using the App, you agree to the practices described in this policy.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="card">
    <h2>2. Data We Collect</h2>
    <p>We collect the following types of data:</p>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Gamer profile</strong> — your genres, platforms, favorite games, mood, and preferences. Stored locally on your device only. Never uploaded to our servers.</li>
      <li><strong>Advertising data</strong> — collected by Google AdMob for Free plan users: approximate location, advertising device identifier, and in-app interactions. Used for ad personalization.</li>
      <li><strong>Crash reports and diagnostics</strong> — anonymous crash logs and performance data used to improve app stability.</li>
      <li><strong>Purchase data</strong> — managed entirely by Google Play. We do not have access to your payment information.</li>
    </ul>
  </div>

  <div class="card">
    <h2>3. How We Use Your Data</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>To provide and improve game recommendations</li>
      <li>To display relevant ads (Free plan users only, via Google AdMob)</li>
      <li>To process PRO subscriptions (via Google Play Billing)</li>
      <li>To diagnose crashes and improve app performance</li>
    </ul>
  </div>

  <div class="card">
    <h2>4. Third-Party Services</h2>
    <p>The App integrates the following third-party services:</p>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Google AdMob</strong> — advertising (Free plan only). See <a href="https://policies.google.com/privacy" target="_blank">Google Privacy Policy</a>.</li>
      <li><strong>Google Play Billing</strong> — subscription management.</li>
      <li><strong>IGDB (Internet Game Database)</strong> — game data provider.</li>
      <li><strong>Steam, Epic Games Store, GOG</strong> — game catalog data.</li>
      <li><strong>OpenCritic</strong> — game ratings data.</li>
    </ul>
    <p>Game data is fetched in real time and is not stored on our servers.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="card">
    <h2>5. Data Storage</h2>
    <p>Your gamer profile and preferences are stored <strong>locally on your device</strong> using Android SharedPreferences. This data never leaves your device.</p>
    <p>We do not operate user accounts or cloud storage for personal data.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="card">
    <h2>6. Data Sharing</h2>
    <p>We do <strong>not sell</strong> your personal data to any third party.</p>
    <p>Data may be shared with third-party services listed in Section 4 only as necessary to operate the App (e.g., showing ads, processing payments).</p>
  </div>

  <div class="card">
    <h2>7. Children's Privacy</h2>
    <p>AI Find Games is not directed at children under 13. We do not knowingly collect personal data from children. If you believe a child has provided us with personal information, contact us at the address below.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="card">
    <h2>8. Your Rights</h2>
    <p>Depending on your location, you may have the right to:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Access the data we hold about you</li>
      <li>Request deletion of your data</li>
      <li>Opt out of personalized advertising (via Android Settings → Privacy → Ads)</li>
    </ul>
    <p>To delete your local gamer profile: go to <strong>Settings → Reset recommendations</strong>, or uninstall the App.</p>
    <p>For any other data request, contact us at: <a href="mailto:lmtechstudio.contact@gmail.com">lmtechstudio.contact@gmail.com</a></p>
  </div>

  <div class="card">
    <h2>9. Changes to This Policy</h2>
    <p>We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. The updated version will be available within the App and at this URL. Continued use of the App after changes constitutes acceptance of the new policy.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="card">
    <h2>10. Contact</h2>
    <p>LM Tech Studio<br/>
    <a href="mailto:lmtechstudio.contact@gmail.com">lmtechstudio.contact@gmail.com</a></p>
  </div>

</div>
</body>
</html>
